{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/我即法则","pageid":8550,"revid":21558,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%88%91%E5%8D%B3%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%88%91%E5%8D%B3%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%88%91%E5%8D%B3%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>我即法则</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.88.91.E5.8D.B3.E6.B3.95.E5.88.99\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"我即法则\"><b>我即法则</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 我即法则.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b4/bj5rkhdt603k1qc50rlxap9pms902w6.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%88%91%E5%8D%B3%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b4/bj5rkhdt603k1qc50rlxap9pms902w6.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%88%91%E5%8D%B3%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b4/bj5rkhdt603k1qc50rlxap9pms902w6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />我即法则\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>1次\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"威慑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">威慑</font></span></span>]，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内友军获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"绝对防护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">绝对防护</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▲物防3</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▲魔防3</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"百分比免伤5\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">百分比免伤5</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合，每场战斗最多使用1次。<br />✦当触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]中[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"生命阈值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">生命阈值</font></span></span>]效果时，本技能重置可用次数，每场战斗最多重置1次。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：最大生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">20%</font>。战斗开始时自动触发1次本效果，不消耗可用次数。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b0/pynau964qq53th9qmfmjo64een57pam.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"78\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b0/pynau964qq53th9qmfmjo64een57pam.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"99\" data-file-height=\"96\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E6%9B%BC\" title=\"角色图鉴库/阿尔曼\"><img alt=\"头像 阿尔曼.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/36/3a3mg0bjgmycxx0wv5gt4hir6dl1m34.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">阿尔曼</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022041108\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.472 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.641 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10054/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 172565/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13341/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  619.515      1 模板:技能\n100.00%  619.515      1 -total\n 15.03%   93.093      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 14.23%   88.180      8 模板:中括号介绍\n  1.37%    8.486      1 模板:面包屑\n  0.79%    4.909      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:8550-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022041108 and revision id 21558. Serialized with PHP